# What a Vercel CLI deploy from the repo root uploads: an allowlist, so .env, PDFs, data/,
# drafts/ and session records can never leave this machine. The site builds from web/ and
# reads ../content at build time (and content/news at runtime), so only those two go up.
/*
!/web
!/content

# Built or installed by Vercel itself.
/web/node_modules
/web/.next

# Local settings files, at any depth.
.env*

# The one exception: public build settings (NEXT_PUBLIC_ values only, never a secret).
!/web/.env.production
